47:35.300 --> 47:37.482
[SPEAKER_01]: Then you would actually be looking out for them.

47:37.502 --> 47:47.268
[SPEAKER_01]: Patronage is the thing that when you cultivate it, it is an imbalance that's implied in that you are somebody that have and they are somebody that have not.

47:48.109 --> 47:57.095
[SPEAKER_01]: But the suggestion and the implication of the patronage is that you are at least interested in their skills and their talents and willing to see them rise.

47:57.996 --> 48:00.938
