48:40.978 --> 48:47.440
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, I could never think of a situation where you would betray Prince Gian or Lord Jameis.

48:49.074 --> 48:56.339
[SPEAKER_01]: So don't ask anybody that you cultivate or imply that you would ever expect that from them.

48:56.699 --> 48:59.681
[SPEAKER_01]: And you'll automatically alleviate a lot of anxiety.

49:00.401 --> 49:07.446
