49:27.390 --> 49:27.610
[SPEAKER_01]: Right.

49:28.070 --> 49:28.231
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

49:29.272 --> 49:33.835
[SPEAKER_01]: But we're talking about you having other people attach themselves to your rising star.

49:36.318 --> 49:36.478
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

49:36.818 --> 49:37.679
[SPEAKER_01]: Makes sense?

49:37.699 --> 49:38.580
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

49:38.600 --> 49:41.022
[SPEAKER_01]: So, like I said, look for those opportunities.

49:42.183 --> 49:44.765
